L682: Visit 3: The measurements take place at the health department and test lab at Norwegian Olympic
L683: Sports Centre in Oslo.
L684:     - Fasting blood samples (venous and fingertip) and urine sample
L685:     - Blood tests after breakfast (venous and fingertip)
L686:     - Performance Tests
